</blockquote> 
<blockquote id="blockquote_44" title="Analysis of the law">(a) The Licensee shall intimate in maximum 10 working days of the site inspection, the charges needed to be deposited by the applicant.
</blockquote> 
<blockquote id="blockquote_45" title="Analysis of the law">(b) The applicant shall deposit the charges within 7 working days of the receipt of the demand note, and furnish the right of way permission if the supply line passes over the property not belonging to the applicant.
