</blockquote> 
<blockquote id="blockquote_60" title="Analysis of the law">(iii) estimated time to execute these works, after site inspection and load sanction;
</blockquote> 
<blockquote id="blockquote_61" title="Analysis of the law">(iv) date of site inspection, at least 7 days in advance when applicant / authorized representative shall be required to be present;
</blockquote> 
<blockquote id="blockquote_62" title="Analysis of the law">(v) security deposit and other applicable charges;
</blockquote> 
