</blockquote> 
<blockquote id="blockquote_67" title="Analysis of the law">(ii) Change in purpose of use of power within same tariff schedule shall be permitted.
</blockquote> 
<blockquote id="blockquote_68" title="Analysis of the law">(iii) If the applicant opts for lesser load than the sanctioned load before signing of agreement, the agreement for the same shall be executed accordingly and the sanction of surrendered load shall stand forfeited.
</blockquote> 
<blockquote id="blockquote_69" title="Analysis of the law">(e) The Licensee shall execute the work expeditiously within-
</blockquote> 
<blockquote id="blockquote_70" title="Analysis of the law">(i) 45 days for loads to be connected with 400 V;
</blockquote> 
<blockquote id="blockquote_71" title="Analysis of the law">(ii) 60 days for loads to be connected at 11 KV;
</blockquote> 
<blockquote id="blockquote_72" title="Analysis of the law">(iii) 120 days to be connected at 33 KV;
</blockquote> 
<blockquote id="blockquote_73" title="Analysis of the law">(iv) 300 days for loads to be connected at 132 KV.
</blockquote> 
<p data-structure="Conclusion" id="p_57" title="Conclusion">from the date of deposit of estimated charges:
</p> 
