</blockquote> 
<blockquote id="blockquote_75" title="Conclusion">- Where extension of lines or augmentation of Distribution Transformer is required .... 60 days,
 
</blockquote><blockquote id="blockquote_76" title="Conclusion">- Where new Distribution Transformer is required .... 120 days and
 
</blockquote><blockquote id="blockquote_77" title="Conclusion">- Where existing 11 KV network needs to be strengthened or existing 66 / 33 KV substation needs to be augmented ...180 days.
</blockquote> 
